WEBVTT

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.070
Sophie's home is marked on the Horror's map!

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.190
Please call Sword!

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:10.440
Hurry!

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:18.740
Run... away...

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:29.310
Sophia Hennes. I have been looking for you.

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:35.970
My master, the King of
El Dorado, summons you.

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:06.040
<i>The monochromatic empty eyes</i>
<i>of</i> <i>sapiens</i> <i>floating</i> <i>within the unreality</i>

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:11.420
<i>Completely peerless flowing</i> <i>blood,</i>
<i>controlled</i> <i>and digitized</i>

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:13.090
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:14.510
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:15.670
<i>Can you see?</i>

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:17.840
<i>(BOOING BOOING) Hellacious</i>

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:19.220
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:20.890
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:21.930
<i>I can see!</i>

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>The timing of the programming</i>

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:24.810
<i>Yea, gotcha!</i>

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:28.520
<i>I want to be eroded away (brain wash)</i>

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:30.690
<i>Up the blast! </i>

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:34.740
<i>Ah, this dying world </i>

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:41.240
<i>Run like you're piercing through it</i>

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:47.580
<i>The rising flames burn everything away </i>

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:52.250
<i>Your resolve and your love</i>

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:55.840
<i>From darkness to the light</i>

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:44.050
Luke!

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.060
Dark knight!

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:59.900
You finally appeared before me!

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.450
Luke! Calm down!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:21.000
This place is dangerous.
We're going to Fei Long's place.

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:06.010
I was thinking you were
just Makai Alchemist trash,

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.400
but you're pretty good.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.470
Wonderful!

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.570
Entertain me more!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.310
Fighting with the strong!

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:22.790
That is the only reason
for my existence in this world!

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:25.570
You bastard!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:55.370
Lower the position of your waist and focus.

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:55.890
Yes!

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.110
That form...

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.670
You were considered
the strongest Silver Knight...

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:20.840
Is this the miserable result?!

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:25.010
If nothing else! I will defeat
you with my own hands!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.350
I see.

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:31.530
You're Luke, aren't you?

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:36.850
You've grown since I last saw you.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:43.870
However.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.400
You're still a fledgling.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:11.700
If nothing else...

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.770
That's all you got?

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.590
Then, I have no need for you.

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:49.890
That's as far as you go!

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:06.970
You bastard...

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:16.970
Hurry and prepare the barrier!
We need to limit the damage!

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:20.270
Take all the Madou tools 
and talismans with you!

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:23.400
We'll make the traffic intersection
in section 21 the defense line.

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:31.990
So you're saying the
dark knight's target, is you?

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:36.240
I don't know! I don't know!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:42.370
My master, the King of
El Dorado, summons you.

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.170
Is it my fault?

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:49.690
Is it my fault that our 
home...? Sister was...?

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:53.630
Why...? Why does a Horror want me?

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.800
Why did Sister have to...?!

00:08:58.800 --> 00:08:59.710
Meifang.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.600
Calm down. Cry now. Not time.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:10.950
Speak properly. Move! Or dead cannot rest!

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:19.880
We must protect the city
from the dark knight.

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:25.040
For now, we'll have you evacuate to safety.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.920
Meifang. Take her to the basement.

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:19.570
Master! It won't hold like this! This is bad!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:26.590
Master?

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:32.120
Small fry are being attracted 
to all the noise.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:37.250
Contact the diner.

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:41.860
Have them call anyone nearby to help.

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:46.760
Prepare for Horror eradication. Hurry!

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:04.160
We protected by barrier here.
Horrors cannot come easy.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:16.360
We have place to rest a
little ahead. Emergency shelter.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:19.380
We rest there until morning.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:34.440
Barrier was broken somewhere?!

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.830
Take her...

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:54.330
El Dorado... To King...

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.630
You okay? Hurry!

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:20.230
Hold on tight!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.930
El Dorado, King?

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.890
Do you have any idea?

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:02.020
Anyways, we go to shelter.

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:06.300
We apologize for interrupting
your regular broadcast. Breaking news.

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:10.240
A massive explosion in the middle
of Russell City has just occurred.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.200
The cause is still under investigation,

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:15.160
but many buildings have
been damaged or destroyed.

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:16.570
Go! Go! Go!

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:40.690
So this is Garo's blade,
the most powerful sword.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.400
Exquisite.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:46.740
A completely different level
than other knights and alchemists.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:54.950
Master, I thank you.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:58.410
Thank you for letting me meet this enemy!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:01.380
It was worth adventuring out of El Dorado!

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.790
Who is this "master" you speak of?

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.460
If you wish to ask, ask with your blade.

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:09.930
The only thing that moves me is strength.

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:14.220
That is why I chose to walk this path!

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:19.180
The strongest Silver Knight... How pathetic!

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.270
Everyone looked up to you!

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:23.770
I admired you!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.430
But you...!

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.350
"One who protects" huh?

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:42.300
Hurry and join me, Golden Knight.

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.520
Duty. Conviction.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:49.150
If you toss aside such worthless chains,
you will become stronger.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.650
You will grasp true power,
that no one can match!

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:54.650
What's the point of that?!

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:58.990
Our strength is for the
people we must protect!

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:03.290
Any power we gain by tossing
them aside has no meaning!

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:07.290
The weak have no worth in living.

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:12.790
Golden Knight.
Let me free you from your shackles.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:07.070
Do you understand now?

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:11.320
The power you believe in is meaningless.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:28.000
Brother!

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.020
Fine.

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:04.740
Wonderful!

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:06.620
This is who you truly are!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:08.370
That's right! Give me more!

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:11.040
As expected of the most
powerful Golden Knight!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:13.380
You are worthy of being my opponent!

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:20.590
How stupid!

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:30.860
What in the world is going on?

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:39.090
I had forgotten.

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:42.340
This feeling. Pain!

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:45.050
Yes! This is pain!

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.920
Let us fight again.

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:09.670
Until then, I leave
Sophia Hennes in your care.

00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:14.150
Sharpen your blade until then!

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:32.600
The police investigation continues
on the explosion from last night.

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:38.520
The cause has yet to be determined,
but currently at the site...

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:45.960
<i>When I close my eyes I feel</i>
<i>gentle</i> <i>arms</i> <i>around</i> <i>me</i>

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:50.430
<i>Warmth and memory</i>

00:22:50.430 --> 00:22:54.810
<i>SIGHT I can feel it now</i>

00:22:54.810 --> 00:22:59.100
<i>Without even saying goodbye</i>

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:07.700
<i>We've chosen different</i> <i>paths</i>
<i>without</i> <i>realizing</i> <i>it</i>

00:23:07.700 --> 00:23:15.330
<i>Forced forward at the mercy of fate</i>

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:17.250
<i>When I'm sad</i>

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:33.180
<i>I keep thinking of your</i>
<i>sweet</i> <i>smile</i> <i>as</i> <i>I</i> <i>look</i> <i>up</i> <i>at the sky</i>

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:37.730
<i>I want to protect you</i>

00:23:37.730 --> 00:23:45.940
<i>I will become strong and keep walking </i>

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:53.160
<i>That's how I will live for another</i>
